ent-ClothingShoesFlippers = 蹼 | flippers
    .desc = 一雙橡膠蛙鞋，穿上後能提升游泳能力。 | A pair of rubber flippers that improves swimming ability when worn.
ent-ClothingShoesLeather = 皮鞋 | leather shoes
    .desc = 這雙靴子非常時尚，採用上等皮革製成。 | Very stylish pair of boots, made from fine leather.
ent-ClothingShoesSlippers = 拖鞋 | slippers
    .desc = 好蓬鬆！ | Fluffy!
ent-ClothingShoeSlippersDuck = 小鴨拖鞋 | ducky slippers
    .desc = 你真希望這些東西在你走路時能發出「嘎嘎」的叫聲。不過，好在它們沒有這樣做。 | You wish these made quacking sounds as you walked. It's a good thing they don't, though.
ent-ClothingShoeSlippersLizard = 蜥蜴絨毛拖鞋 | lizard plushie slippers
    .desc = 一雙造型可愛、酷似蜥蜴人的拖鞋。搭配其他綠色服裝，你就會成為太空站上最酷的船員！ | An adorable pair of slippers that resemble a lizardperson. Combine this with some other green clothing and you'll be the coolest crewmember on the station!
ent-ClothingShoesTourist = 旅遊鞋 | tourist shoes
    .desc = 這雙便宜的涼鞋看起來不太舒服。 | These cheap sandals don't look very comfortable.
ent-ClothingShoesDameDane = 黑道鞋 | yakuza shoes
    .desc = 總算…… | At last...
ent-ClothingShoesSnakeskinBoots = 蛇皮靴 | snakeskin boots
    .desc = 這雙由曾經極為珍貴的蛇皮製成的靴子，周遭的人肯定都會羨慕不已。 | Boots made of once-valuable snakeskin, everyone around you would have been jealous.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsSpeed = 速度靴 | speed boots
    .desc = 採用量子纖維編織而成的高科技靴子，能夠將電力轉化為純粹的速度！ | High-tech boots woven with quantum fibers, able to convert electricity into pure speed!
ent-ActionToggleSpeedBoots = Toggle Speed 雪靴 | Toggle Speed Boots
    .desc = 開啟或關閉速度靴。 | Toggles the speed boots on and off.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsMoon = 月亮靴 | moon boots
    .desc = 採用特殊配方混合月球岩石凝膠所研發的特殊抗重力靴。從荷蘭寄出。 | Special anti-gravity boots developed with a speciality blend of lunar rock gel. Shipped from the Netherlands.
ent-ClothingShoesBootsJump = 跳躍靴 | jump boots
    .desc = 這雙高科技靴子能賦予你驚人的跳躍能力！穿上這雙靴子，你就能跳過熔岩、深淵，以及地面上的各種奇怪化學物質！ | High-tech boots that give you the incredible ability to JUMP! With these boots you can jump over lava, chasms and weird chemicals on the floor!
